Lock down the role trust policy. Replace the wildcard principal with the
specific IAM ARNs or federated providers allowed to assume the role, and add
a condition such as `aws:PrincipalOrgID` or `sts:ExternalId`:
assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
  Version = "2012-10-17"
  Statement = [{
    Effect    = "Allow"
    Principal = { AWS = "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/DeployRole" }
    Action    = "sts:AssumeRole"
    Condition = { StringEquals = { "sts:ExternalId" = "unique-value" } }
  }]
})

